infinite-patch 1
# First sound: press play and hear notes
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 340
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 480 340
  f volume 0.5
end
node 3 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 1340 318
end
node 4 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text First sound. Notes go into a synth, the synth goes to the speakers. Follow the wires left to right.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 5 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text The Notes box plays a new random note every quarter beat. Try changing Rate, or the Low and High note range.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 156
  s text The Analog synth turns each note into a sound. Try turning Volume down or changing the Wave of oscillator 1.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 1340 156
  s text Audio Out sends the sound to your speakers. Every sound needs to reach one of these.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
